// 8 outputs, a full crossbar of 24:1 muxes per element input.
// M22: LUT contents and crossbar in CFGLUT5 (128 per CLB; M23: OR roots), loaded by
// hw/src/core/lut_loader.v as the tile's frames are written: lce[f] shifts tile frame f
// (0 xbar, 1 init, 2 init, 3 xbar), lcdi_* are the shared expander's
